><c>can </c><00:00:01.842><c>construct </c><00:00:01.844><c>a </c><00:00:01.846><c>model </c><00:00:01.848><c>that </c><00:00:01.850><c>involves </c><00:00:01.852><c>a  </c><00:00:01.854><c>number </c><00:00:01.856><c>of </c><00:00:01.858><c>different </c><00:00:01.860><c>scenarios </c><00:00:01.862><c>and </c><00:00:01.864><c>by  </c><00:00:01.866><c>knowing </c><00:00:01.868><c>the </c><00:00:01.870><c>probability </c><00:00:01.872><c>distribution  </c><00:00:01.874><c>under  </c><00:00:01.876><c>one </c><00:00:01.878><c>of </c><00:00:01.880><c>the </c><00:00:01.882><c>scenarios </c><00:00:01.884><c>we </c><00:00:01.886><c>can </c><00:00:01.888><c>find </c><00:00:01.890><c>the  </c><00:00:01.892><c>probability </c><00:00:01.894><c>distribution </c><00:00:01.896><c>overall </c><00:00:01.898><c>and </c><00:00:01.900><c>we  </c><00:00:01.902><c>can </c><00:00:01.904><c>also </c><00:00:01.906><c>find </c><00:00:01.908><c>the </c><00:00:01.910><c>expected </c><00:00:01.912><c>value </c><00:00:01.914><c>for </c><00:00:01.916><c>the  </c><00:00:01.918><c>overall </c><00:00:01.920><c>experiment</c>

